Note on vocabulary content
==========================

The MIT License in LICENSE covers the source code, build configuration and
tooling in this repository.

It does not cover the vocabulary word lists themselves. Those selections derive
from "504 Absolutely Essential Words" (Barron's) and "400 Must-Have Words for
the TOEFL" (McGraw-Hill), which remain the property of their respective
publishers. The definitions stored in this repository are the author's own study
notes rather than the publishers' text.

Anyone reusing this project is free to take the code and replace the contents of
Resources/VocabData/ with their own material.
